This repository is not uniformly licensed.

It is a device-specific, slim subset of panvk-kbase-android
(https://github.com/zenithblue-oss/panvk-kbase-android) and mixes:

- MIT for repository scaffolding and this tree's modifications
  (see LICENSES/MIT.txt),
- Mesa's upstream licenses for Mesa-derived patches under patches/**
  (see LICENSES/README.md),
- GPL-2.0 WITH Linux-syscall-note for the vendored kbase UAPI headers under
  patches/kbase-common/files/ only.

The authoritative description is NOTICE.md, with per-tree details in
LICENSES/README.md and the license texts in LICENSES/.
